{
  "summary": "The experiment tested an RNA-only model using PCA_n2000 encoder with singleprofile setting, no image or fusion components. Validation accuracy of 0.485 suggests a baseline performance for RNA-only models, supported by a validation F1 score of 0.464. The result establishes a minimal configuration baseline, but uncertainty remains about the impact of additional modalities or model complexity without direct comparative evidence."
}

